    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cube Guardian: Tower Defender is a rogue-like tower defense game set on a procedurally generated, cube-based battlefield. Your mission is to protect the central Nexus by strategically placing buildings on multiple cube levels while managing your energy and money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The placement of your defenses is crucial\u2014each cube offers unique tactical advantages, and every decision matters as enemy waves become increasingly formidable. With each level-up, you choose from various upgrades to strengthen your existing defenses or unlock new options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The challenge intensifies every 10 seconds, testing your strategy and quick reflexes. While defeat is inevitable, your goal is to push your limits and achieve the highest score possible.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cube Guardian: Tower Defender is a rogue-like tower defense game set on a procedurally generated, cube-based battlefield. Your mission is to protect the central Nexus by strategically placing buildings on multiple cube levels while managing your energy and money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The placement of your defenses is crucial\u2014each cube offers unique tactical advantages, and every decision matters as enemy waves become increasingly formidable. With each level-up, you choose from various upgrades to strengthen your existing defenses or unlock new options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The challenge intensifies every 10 seconds, testing your strategy and quick reflexes. While defeat is inevitable, your goal is to push your limits and achieve the highest score possible.</p>",
